WinSCP Setup - transferring files from windows to Linux
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
here we will use .ppk file. launch an instance with .ppk file
WinSCP is a tool that is used to transfer file from windows to linux

download winscp to laptop : https://winscp.net/eng/download.php

in VM makes sure you are in /home/ec2-user  ---> create one empty file in this path

open winscp in laaptop  ---> in this login window, file protocol:SFTP ---> click on close 
---> you will see 2windows. in both windows you will see the download folder (by default)

In the top bar(right side) --->new tab ...> file protocol:SFTP ---> hostname:publiic IP of VM, port no 22,username:ec2-user 
--->click on advanced ---> SSH(left pane) --->Authentication(left pane) 
---> under the "private key file" click on ...(3dots) and select the ppk file ---> ok ---> login --->accept 


